        ("m = base * _translate_matrix(-pivot) * _orbit_matrix(orbit) * _translate_matrix(pivot)", 'Rotating around a point: move so the pivot is at the origin, rotate, move back. (Maya multiplies row vectors, so the order reads left to right.)'),
